SET SYSMENU TO
SET SYSMENU AUTOMATIC

DEFINE PAD _3720zuldt OF _MSYSMENU PROMPT "Graph Transaction" COLOR SCHEME 3 ;
	KEY ALT+G, ""
DEFINE PAD _3720zuldu OF _MSYSMENU PROMPT "Report" COLOR SCHEME 3 ;
	KEY ALT+R, ""
DEFINE PAD _3720zuldv OF _MSYSMENU PROMPT "Exit" COLOR SCHEME 3 ;
	KEY ALT+E, ""
ON PAD _3720zuldt OF _MSYSMENU ACTIVATE POPUP graphtrans
ON PAD _3720zuldu OF _MSYSMENU ACTIVATE POPUP newitem
ON SELECTION PAD _3720zuldv OF _MSYSMENU do endprg

DEFINE POPUP graphtrans MARGIN RELATIVE SHADOW COLOR SCHEME 4
DEFINE BAR 1 OF graphtrans PROMPT "Master Graph Entry/Edit/Del"
DEFINE BAR 2 OF graphtrans PROMPT "Graph Register Entry/Edit/Del"
DEFINE BAR 3 OF graphtrans PROMPT "Supplier Entry"
ON SELECTION BAR 1 OF graphtrans do form grmainmaster
ON SELECTION BAR 2 OF graphtrans do form grmainregistr
ON SELECTION BAR 3 OF graphtrans do form grmainsupplier

DEFINE POPUP newitem MARGIN RELATIVE SHADOW COLOR SCHEME 4
DEFINE BAR 1 OF newitem PROMPT "Graphs Available for Carpet Order"
DEFINE BAR 2 OF newitem PROMPT "Supplier Issue - Recive"
DEFINE BAR 3 OF newitem PROMPT "Graph Stock in Hand"
DEFINE BAR 4 OF newitem PROMPT "Rprctag"
ON SELECTION BAR 1 OF newitem do form grordporep
ON SELECTION BAR 2 OF newitem do form grsearchregissrevp
ON SELECTION BAR 4 OF newitem do form rprctag
